<p><code>Groups</code> and <code>Tests</code> always use <code>default_factory</code>, because they
  construct component instances:</p>

{{ codeblock.block('tests = OrcraftConfigField.Tests(
	default_factory=lambda: [
		MyFirstTest(),
		MySecondTest(),
	]
)') }}

<p><code>Matrix</code> and <code>Dimension</code> have options of their own - generated values, exclusion
  rules, randomization and seeding. They are covered in
  <a class="text-accent" href="/framework/matrix/">Orcraft Matrix</a>, alongside what they
  produce.</p>

